From e.pebesma at geog.uu.nl  Thu Jun 27 07:52:23 2002
From: e.pebesma at geog.uu.nl (Edzer J. Pebesma)
Date: Wed Nov 14 16:58:10 2007
Subject: [STATSGRASS] gstat_compilation_error
References: <3D1AFA34.7050607@deprem.gov.tr>
